<http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Shawl of woven silk, Great Britain, ca. 1825-1845."@en , "Shawl of woven silk in bright yellow, with applied edge and wool fringe. The narrow borders are applied so as to 'turn-over' to show all borders when folded double in a triangle. \n\nThe borders have a deep purplish-red ground and a single meander of large and small flowers in the same red, mid-blue, mid-green, pale blue, black, white, pinky-orange and bright yellow. These are flanked by tiny guard-stripes of flowerheads and leaves in the same colours, the guard-stripes marking off a square at the corners."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0a5d6408-2481-39f8-8006-9382a23563df> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/27adcb25-d5bd-3a71-87b4-24f38ce2d341> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9012ac64-0f31-3c2d-b63b-2f4151f12d1b> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Shawl of woven silk in bright yellow, with applied edge and wool fringe. The narrow borders are applied so as to 'turn-over' to show all borders when folded double in a triangle. \n\nThe borders have a deep purplish-red ground and a single meander of large and small flowers in the same red, mid-blue, mid-green, pale blue, black, white, pinky-orange and bright yellow. These are flanked by tiny guard-stripes of flowerheads and leaves in the same colours, the guard-stripes marking off a square at the corners."@en , "Shawl of woven silk, Great Britain, ca. 1825-1845."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8aba3c0f-d6d6-39d6-ac63-534524a807cc/dimension/5> ;
